    {
      "name": "Shift Mood",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The capritellix rotates the segments of their face, changing their personality and demeanor. Until they Shift their Mood again, the capritellix gains a +4 status bonus to a certain skill and to their Will DC against that skill, as well as a specific occult innate spell they can cast at will (9th rank, DC 38).</p>\n<p><strong>Angry</strong> Intimidation, Dominate</p>\n<p><strong>Gregarious</strong> Performance, Uncontrollable Dance</p>\n<p><strong>Serene</strong> Diplomacy, Suggestion</p>\n<p><strong>Sly</strong> Deception, Warp Mind</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
